Date: Mon, 19 May 2014 20:56:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 04/11] platinum: add support for  specific fields
 dateadded, rating, votes and artwork

:dateadded to pass dateadded with items and not need to stat upnp resources for that
:rating for number-based rating
:votes for string-based votes number
:artwork for a type-url-based mapping of artwork
